1
00:00:00,276 --> 00:00:02,196
That's it, I'm out of here.

2
00:00:02,361 --> 00:00:03,441
(Past Leonard:)Joyce, come on.

3
00:00:03,613 --> 00:00:04,863
Twelve hours?

4
00:00:07,241 --> 00:00:09,371
(Penny:)Oh, my God.

5
00:00:09,535 --> 00:00:12,875
(Leonard:)-Do I get some sympathy now?
-Little bit.

6
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:18,880
(Penny:)Let me get this straight.

7
00:00:19,045 --> 00:00:22,505
You move in with this guy, makes
you sign a ridiculous roommate agreement.

8
00:00:22,673 --> 00:00:25,633
(Penny:)Then he walks into your bedroom
while you're doing Joyce Kim...

9
00:00:25,801 --> 00:00:26,841
(Penny:)...and you still stay?

10
00:00:27,011 --> 00:00:29,681
(Leonard:)Actually, I couldn't get too mad at him
about Joyce Kim.

11
00:00:29,847 --> 00:00:31,057
(Penny:)Why not?

12
00:00:31,223 --> 00:00:33,893
(Leonard:)Well, I was doing some
government research at the time.

13
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,850
You know, military rocket fuels.
Kind of secret.

14
00:00:37,021 --> 00:00:39,691
-What does that have to do with Joyce?
-As it turns out...

15
00:00:39,857 --> 00:00:41,737
(Leonard:)...she was a North Korean spy.

16
00:00:44,111 --> 00:00:47,241
(Leonard:)Luckily, Sheldon drove her out
before I revealed anything important.

17
00:00:47,406 --> 00:00:50,286
(Leonard:)Which I'm not saying I would have.

18
00:00:51,243 --> 00:00:53,413
So you stayed with Sheldon
all this time...

19
00:00:53,579 --> 00:00:55,999
(Penny:)...because he kept you from going
to federal prison?

20
00:00:56,749 --> 00:01:00,089
That's part of it. The other part is
what happened with the elevator.

